---
import { Zap, Cpu, MousePointer, ShieldCheck, Filter, Layers } from 'lucide-react';
---

<section id="features" class="py-20 lg:py-28 border-y border-border-custom bg-bg-secondary/20">
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-7xl px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
    <!-- Section Header -->
    <div class="text-center max-w-3xl mx-auto mb-16 lg:mb-20 reveal">
      <h2 class="font-display text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-bold tracking-tight text-text-main mb-4">
        Built for Speed. Engineered for Control.
      </h2>
      <p class="font-body text-sm sm:text-base text-text-muted">
        Warp Transfer completely re-thinks Android-to-PC file copies, packaging developer-grade utilities inside a highly-refined fluent interface.
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- Bento Grid -->
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-6">
      
      <!-- Feature 1: Parallel workers -->
      <div class="flex flex-col rounded-2xl p-6 glass-panel glass-panel-hover reveal">
        <div class="flex h-10 w-10 items-center justify-center rounded-xl bg-gold-glow border border-gold/20 text-gold mb-6">
          <Cpu className="h-5 w-5" />
        </div>
        <h3 class="font-display text-lg font-bold text-text-main mb-2">Parallel Copy Pipelines</h3>
        <p class="font-body text-xs sm:text-sm text-text-muted leading-relaxed">
          Open multiple concurrent worker channels to copy folders containing thousands of items (like camera DCIM). By copying in parallel, MTP sequential bottlenecks are completely eliminated.
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- Feature 2: Auto setup -->
      <div class="flex flex-col rounded-2xl p-6 glass-panel glass-panel-hover reveal">
        <div class="flex h-10 w-10 items-center justify-center rounded-xl bg-gold-glow border border-gold/20 text-gold mb-6">
          <Zap className="h-5 w-5" />
        </div>
        <h3 class="font-display text-lg font-bold text-text-main mb-2">Platform-Tools Auto Config</h3>
        <p class="font-body text-xs sm:text-sm text-text-muted leading-relaxed">
          Never touch the command line. On the first launch, Warp Transfer automatically detects, downloads, and configures the latest Android Debug Bridge (ADB) binaries silently in the background.
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- Feature 3: Drag & Drop -->
      <div class="flex flex-col rounded-2xl p-6 glass-panel glass-panel-hover reveal">
        <div class="flex h-10 w-10 items-center justify-center rounded-xl bg-gold-glow border border-gold/20 text-gold mb-6">
          <MousePointer className="h-5 w-5" />
        </div>
        <h3 class="font-display text-lg font-bold text-text-main mb-2">Bi-directional Drag & Drop</h3>
        <p class="font-body text-xs sm:text-sm text-text-muted leading-relaxed">
          Need to push files to your phone? Simply drag any file or folder from Windows Explorer directly into the app's drag zone to push them straight to `/sdcard/Download`.
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- Feature 4: Safety / Move integrity -->
      <div class="flex flex-col rounded-2xl p-6 glass-panel glass-panel-hover reveal">
        <div class="flex h-10 w-10 items-center justify-center rounded-xl bg-gold-glow border border-gold/20 text-gold mb-6">
          <ShieldCheck className="h-5 w-5" />
        </div>
        <h3 class="font-display text-lg font-bold text-text-main mb-2">Integrity Safeguards</h3>
        <p class="font-body text-xs sm:text-sm text-text-muted leading-relaxed">
          During "Move" operations, the app verifies exact file presence and byte matches on the destination side before deleting the source, protecting against data loss.
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- Feature 5: Category Filters -->
      <div class="flex flex-col rounded-2xl p-6 glass-panel glass-panel-hover reveal">
        <div class="flex h-10 w-10 items-center justify-center rounded-xl bg-gold-glow border border-gold/20 text-gold mb-6">
          <Filter className="h-5 w-5" />
        </div>
        <h3 class="font-display text-lg font-bold text-text-main mb-2">Smart Presets & Caps</h3>
        <p class="font-body text-xs sm:text-sm text-text-muted leading-relaxed">
          Filter files by category (Photos Only / Videos Only) with a single click. Cap transfer speeds (e.g. 2 MB/s, 10 MB/s) to keep CPU overhead low and phone thermal states cool.
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- Feature 6: Multi-device picker -->
      <div class="flex flex-col rounded-2xl p-6 glass-panel glass-panel-hover reveal">
        <div class="flex h-10 w-10 items-center justify-center rounded-xl bg-gold-glow border border-gold/20 text-gold mb-6">
          <Layers className="h-5 w-5" />
        </div>
        <h3 class="font-display text-lg font-bold text-text-main mb-2">Multi-Device Picker</h3>
        <p class="font-body text-xs sm:text-sm text-text-muted leading-relaxed">
          Plug in multiple Android devices, emulators, or wireless connections, and toggle between them dynamically via a clean fluent picker menu on the main interface.
        </p>
      </div>

    </div>
  </div>
</section>
